{"id": "12", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "TY", "text": "[warm] The next morning, everything was normal again."}, {"speaker": "ANCHOR", "text": "[cheerful] Good news, everyone! Robux are once again just a fun game currency. And bread is back to two dollars!"}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "Dad got paid in real dollars. Mom used her coupons. And Grandma changed her password. [pause] For real this time."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[joyful, sipping] The coffee machine is FREE again!"}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "And Grandma's stream still gets two million viewers. [pause] She does charity streams now."}, {"speaker": "GRANDMA", "text": "[proud] It's \"password three\"!"}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[sighs] ...We're working on it."}, {"speaker": "MIA", "text": "[content] And my four hundred and twelve hats are worth exactly nothing again. [pause] I've never been happier."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "And me? [pause] I'm broke again. [laughs] Totally, completely broke."}, {"speaker": "PICKLE", "text": "[warm] Here. One Robux. For your next mansion."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[touched] ...Thanks, Pickle. [pause] I'm spending it on a shoe. For you."}, {"speaker": "PICKLE", "text": "[gasps happily] A SHOE?!"}, {"speaker": "MIA", "text": "[grudging] For the record... you were a pretty okay millionaire. [pause] For like a day."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[smiling] Thanks, Mia."}, {"speaker": "ANCHOR", "text": "[breaking news] This just in! Starting tomorrow... EVERY video game coin becomes real money!"}, {"speaker": "PICKLE", "text": "[excited] I have twelve of those too!"}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[deadpan, to camera] ...Oh no."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 2.96, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 53, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9", "start_time_seconds": 2.96, "end_time_seconds": 11.440000000000001, "character_start_index": 53, "